------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web TripLegList.tsx -> native, reproduced + tested)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  DATA      : web props `legs: TripLeg[]` + `chargeStops: TripChargeStop[]` (SI: meters, seconds, Wh;
              SOC %) -> TripLegData / TripChargeStopData; bound via the P1/S8 state-holder seam
              (TripLegListSource); the view performs no networking. useUnits (unitPrefs.distance,
              formatEnergy) + useFormatting (formatCurrency) -> TripLegFormatConfig (make(from:) derives
              mi/km, trim-then-keep currency symbol, floor/finite/>=0 precision, blank-locale->en-US).
  PROJECTION: web `legItems.map((leg, idx) => …)` (order-preserving) + the `idx < stops.length`
              interleave that attaches a charge stop after a leg -> TripLegRowBuilder.build; extra
              stops beyond the leg count are dropped (web parity).
  DISTANCE  : web `convertDistanceFromSI(distance_m, unit).toFixed(1) + " " + unit` -> TripLegFormat
              (meters/1000 km, meters/1609.344 mi; JS toFixed semantics via String(format:"%.1f")).
  DURATION  : web LEG `Math.round(leg.duration_s)` labelled "min" (TripLegList.tsx L70) reproduced
              VERBATIM — the raw seconds value rounded, NOT a seconds->minutes conversion; the CHARGE
              STOP divides by 60 (L99). Both ported exactly; documented in Adapter.swift as a faithful
              port, not a silent "fix".
  ENERGY    : web `formatEnergy(energy_wh,{precision:1})` -> Wh/1000 kWh, locale-grouped at 1 fraction
              digit + " kWh" (DEFAULT_ENERGY_PREF); non-finite -> "—".
  CURRENCY  : web `formatCurrency(cost)` -> currencySymbol + locale-grouped fmtNumber at userPrecision;
              non-finite collapses to 0 (safeNumber).
  SOC       : web `Math.round(start)% → Math.round(arrival)%`; arrival<20 -> danger tint else warning;
              start -> success; charge-stop band "from% → to%".
  LABEL     : web `name || \`${lat.toFixed(2)}, ${lng.toFixed(2)}\`` -> JS `||` truthiness
              (empty-string-only falsy) reproduced via name.isEmpty.
  COLOUR    : web emerald/rose/amber/blue hex -> exact design tokens (statusSuccess / statusDanger /
              statusWarning / statusInfo) per ADR-006 semantic mapping; no raw hex, no Tailwind ports.
  ICON      : web lucide MapPin/Zap/Clock/ArrowRight -> SF Symbols (mappin.circle.fill / bolt.fill /
              clock / arrow.right); decorative icons accessibilityHidden.
  STATES    : data (interleaved leg + charge-stop cards) · empty (TSEmptyState inside the titled panel,
              web `legItems.length === 0`) · loading skeleton · error+retry (QueryError equiv) ·
              stale chip+1-shot auto-refresh · offline chip — every state renders; the "Route Breakdown"
              h3 title is always shown (web parity). Verified by per-state #Preview + projection/model tests.
  LAYOUT    : metric grid + charge-stop meta use adaptive LazyVGrid (web `grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4` /
              `flex-wrap`), responsive across iPhone/iPad/macOS + Dynamic Type.
  I18N      : all 8 source keys (tripPlanner.legs.title/empty/distance/duration/energy/soc/recommended,
              common.min) present in the TripLegList.strings table (P1/S10); no English literals in code
              — every string resolves through TripLegListStrings facade.
  A11Y      : per-leg + per-stop combined VoiceOver summary (route + metrics), header trait on the title,
              decorative icons hidden, the freshness chip + retry are labelled buttons, Dynamic Type via
              Font.TS tokens, Reduce Motion via TSFadeIn.
  TELEMETRY : `view.opened surface=TripLegList` emitted once on start (P1/S11), asserted by test.

